    </div>
    <p class="tiny" style="margin-top: 32px">
      Code Apache 2.0 · Whitepaper CC BY 4.0, doi:10.5281/zenodo.20580927 · Questions:{' '}
      <a href="https://mru.space/contact/">Get in touch</a>
